./iterations/iter_010/solution_critic_01.md:58:- Aad W. van der Vaart and Jon A. Wellner. *Weak Convergence and Empirical Processes*, Springer, 1996. https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-1-4757-2545-2. Relevant as general background for uniform convergence over indexed function classes; the current proof uses only a finite bracketing special case.
