./iterations/iter_014/consolidation.md:13:- Finite LP experiments for small two-level paths and cumulative diluted-conflict constructions.
./iterations/iter_014/consolidation.md:18:- Corrected: alternating \(\ell,h\) finite prefixes do not always have exact \(D_n=0\).
