./logs/iter_003_idea_02_explorer_01_critic_01.stderr.log:1581:The Blackwell/no-regret citation is valid but not directly supportive of the lower bound. Approachability/calibration cannot overcome an infeasible pair of prefix constraints; it could only help if the simultaneous-horizon target set were feasible.
