./logs/iter_010_idea_02_explorer_01.stderr.log:5708:./logs/iter_008_synthesis.stderr.log:3829:+Status: accepted for same-path horizon-oblivious lower bounds. The increasing order of thresholds is essential; otherwise the effective threshold by \(T_j\) is \(\max_{\ell\le j}c_\ell\), not \(c_j\). Horizon-aware policies, comparator `max`, or repeated-fill rewards invalidate the stated proof.
